blocks.en:
Let $S$ be a smooth, bounded surface in the interior of $\Omega\subset\mathbb{R}^3$ and let $g:S\to R$ be in $L^2(S)$. (We can think of $g$ as a distribution of surface charge on $S$.) Then the distribution generated by $g$ is in $H^{-1}(\Omega)$. To see this we use the trace theorem to note that for any smooth function $\phi$ we have\[\begin{aligned}
|(g,\phi)|&=\left|\int_Sg(\bm{x})\phi(\bm{x})\,\mathrm{d}A(\bm{x})\right|\\
&\leq\|g\|_{L^2(S)}\|\phi\|_{L^2(S)}\\
&\leq\|g\|_{L^2(S)}\|\phi\|_{H^{1/2}(S)}\\
&\leq\|g\|_{L^2(S)}\|\phi\|_{H^1(\Omega)}
\end{aligned}\]Thus, the surface distribution $g$ defines a bounded linear functional on functions in $H^1(\Omega)$.

blocks.zh:
设 $S$ 为 $\Omega\subset\mathbb{R}^3$ 内部的光滑有界曲面, $g:S\to R$ 属于 $L^2(S)$. (可将 $g$ 看作 $S$ 上的面电荷分布.) 那么由 $g$ 生成的分布属于 $H^{-1}(\Omega)$. 为说明这一点, 利用迹定理注意到对任意光滑函数 $\phi$ 有\[\begin{aligned}
|(g,\phi)|&=\left|\int_Sg(\bm{x})\phi(\bm{x})\,\mathrm{d}A(\bm{x})\right|\\
&\leq\|g\|_{L^2(S)}\|\phi\|_{L^2(S)}\\
&\leq\|g\|_{L^2(S)}\|\phi\|_{H^{1/2}(S)}\\
&\leq\|g\|_{L^2(S)}\|\phi\|_{H^1(\Omega)}
\end{aligned}\]因此, 面分布 $g$ 定义了 $H^1(\Omega)$ 中函数上的有界线性泛函.

blocks.en:
We can also characterize functions in negative Sobolev spaces as derivatives of functions in positive Sobolev spaces. Let $f\in H^{-k}(\Omega)$. By the Riesz representation theorem, there is then a unique $u\in H_0^k(\Omega)$ with the property that
\begin{equation}\label{eq:negative-sobolev-riesz-representation}
(f,v)=(u,v)_k
\end{equation}
for every $v\in H_0^k(\Omega)$. How is $u$ related to $f$? From \eqref{eq:negative-sobolev-riesz-representation} we find that, for any test function $\phi$,
\begin{equation}\label{eq:negative-sobolev-riesz-derivative-pairings}
(f,\phi)=\sum_{|\alpha|\leq k}(D^\alpha u,D^\alpha\phi)=\sum_{|\alpha|\leq k}(-1)^{|\alpha|}(D^{2\alpha}u,\phi),
\end{equation}
i.e.,
\begin{equation}\label{eq:negative-sobolev-elliptic-derivative-representation}
f=\sum_{|\alpha|\leq k}(-1)^{|\alpha|}D^{2\alpha}u.
\end{equation}

blocks.zh:
也可将负阶 Sobolev 空间中的函数刻画为正阶 Sobolev 空间中函数的导数. 设 $f\in H^{-k}(\Omega)$. 由 Riesz 表示定理, 存在唯一的 $u\in H_0^k(\Omega)$, 使对每个 $v\in H_0^k(\Omega)$ 有
\begin{equation}\label{eq:negative-sobolev-riesz-representation}
(f,v)=(u,v)_k
\end{equation}
$u$ 与 $f$ 有什么关系? 由 \eqref{eq:negative-sobolev-riesz-representation} 可知, 对任意试验函数 $\phi$,
\begin{equation}\label{eq:negative-sobolev-riesz-derivative-pairings}
(f,\phi)=\sum_{|\alpha|\leq k}(D^\alpha u,D^\alpha\phi)=\sum_{|\alpha|\leq k}(-1)^{|\alpha|}(D^{2\alpha}u,\phi),
\end{equation}
即
\begin{equation}\label{eq:negative-sobolev-elliptic-derivative-representation}
f=\sum_{|\alpha|\leq k}(-1)^{|\alpha|}D^{2\alpha}u.
\end{equation}
